{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heros have been defeated. The wizards of light are dead. Only darkness remains. All that is retained within the world belongs to its shadows; hatred and resentment for their own kind fester in lieu of a common good to fight against. All who reside here wish to be the Ruler of the Dark. But, alas, there may be but one who reigns supreme over all manner of nightly frights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a necromancer. Others of your kind are trying to take you down! They wish you removed from the prospects for Ruler of the Darkness! Command your summoned units to the other side of the board and defeat their necromancer before they defeat yours! Fight your way through enemy mobs by attacking and sacrificing both your units and theirs! BUT! Be warned! For death is not necessarily the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally developed by The Zivraye Group for Jamsepticeye (2025) game jam!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4146970?t=1774278324","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146970/9d4beeb6c3f16f25b798584ff17a5a4361d600d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774278324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146970/8206c4e30053c54eea4a4584a168c4a080b7c89e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774278324","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146970/8206c4e30053c54eea4a4584a168c4a080b7c89e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774278324","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"descript